Well, maybe he's caught...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:05.880
too tight. No, I think it's because he spent too much time in the son of Beth. The heat affected

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:12.940
his predictor. His predictor? You ought to be ashamed of yourself, palming off a fraudulent pig

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:19.090
as a millionaire. I don't know why you're blaming Mr. Grata. When you thought that Arnold was a

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:24.480
millionaire, you frowned all over him. But now that he blew it with his tail, you're treating him

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:29.920
like he was a nothing. Well, to you, he may be a nothing, but to me, he'll always be a big pig.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.630
Well said, Mrs. Grotter. Let's go pack.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.090
We packed for you.

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.000
Well, all right, let's get out of here.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.940
Not until you've paid your bill.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.730
I'll be glad to.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.480
$885 for what?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:47.880
It's all itemized.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.540
$350 for the royal suite for one night.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.500
$228 for room service.

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:55.440
Room service?

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:58.120
Arnold threw a champagne party for all the chambermates.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:18:59.980
And $188 for the royal suite.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.360
$25 for repapering the ping-pong room.

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:05.720
Arnold didn't like the wallpaper.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.590
Well, all I'm paying for is that so-called junior suite now.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:11.490
Now, how much was that?

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:16.650
$6 for the room and $25 for the services of the hotel doctor.

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:19.000
Here's your money.

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:21.730
I have got a cab.

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:22.130
Yes, sir.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:24.520
Who's going to pay the pig's bill?

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:25.790
Get it from him.

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.820
I will, one way or another.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.480
What do you mean by that?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.670
If we don't get it in cash, we'll take it out in pork.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.340
Oh, don't worry, Arnold.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.700
We won't let them sausage you up.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:40.420
Oliver?

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:41.900
Mr. Douglas!

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:47.910
In July?

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:59.450
Mr. Zippel, I can't tell you how honored we are to have you staying at our hotel again.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.600
I just can't believe it

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.270
I think it's wonderful

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:17.280
And you're wonderful for all you've done for Arnold

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:20.140
Well, it's a pig lawyer's job

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.280
To look out for his client

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.190
What about a pig lawyer's wife?

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.140
Does he also look after her?

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:26.760
You know it

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.140
There's a bottle of champagne under the bed.

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:33.350
Arnold sent it down.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:35.990
He's giving another champagne party for the chambermaids.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.510
Well, no wonder we can't get any towels.

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.370
Oh, well, he's having fun.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:40.730
Yeah, he better be careful.

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:42.730
He's going to spend all his money before he gets it.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:43.950
When does he get it?

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.770
Oh, there's a lot of red tape to go through.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:47.050
The will has to go to probate.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:48.610
All kinds of papers to be signed.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.890
Why don't you get a couple of glasses from the bathroom for the champagne?

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:54.240
Hey, good idea.

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:57.310
Bye.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.770
the water in the tub.

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.290
Well, as long as I'm here,

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:07.580
I'll take a hot bath.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.160
We'll be right back.
